 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "detectedWords lists flagged keywords (repeats allowed); categories maps each keyword to one category through [keyword, category] pairs (keywords are distinct); username names the recipient. Ignore detected words with no category. Return the email body as lines joined by \"\\n\": first \"Dear <username>,\"; then, if nothing was mapped, \"No violations found.\"; otherwise one line per category in ascending string order, \"<category>: \" followed by that category's distinct keywords in order of first detection, each written \"<keyword> (<times detected>)\" and separated by \", \".",
